<title>NETHERLANDS: DSM posts 223 mln guilder Q1 net profit.</title>
<headline>DSM posts 223 mln guilder Q1 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit incl. extraordinary items     223  vs  205</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items			    NIL  vs  10 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			   2.99  vs  2.60</p>
<p>    Operating profit				 304  vs  294</p>
<p>    Financial charges				 17  vs  14</p>
<p>    Minority interests			     NIL  vs   1</p>
<p>    Tax on ord activities			   82  vs  83</p>
<p>Note - Analysts had forecast DSM NV's first quarter net profit before extraordinaries at 185-233 million guilders. Consensus was at 216.8 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Net per ord share (guilders)		7.36  vs  5.88</p>
<p>    Net per ord share (guilders)		7.36  vs  7.03*</p>
<p>* Based on number of ordinary shares outstanding at end of first quarter 1996 after conversion of 20 percent of shares into cumulative preference shares on 12 March 1996.</p>
</text>
